.Dd June 26, 2026
.Dt LIBFSFAT 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm libfsfat.h
.Nd Library to access the File Allocation Table (FAT) file system format
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In libfsfat.h
.Pp
